    "identifier": "skyforce",
    "description": "<p>(To cast this jutsu, the target must be airborne) Fuel your weapon with sapping chakra and strike your opponent in their abdomen. Make a melee taijutsu attack against an airborne target. On hit they take your [Weapons damage] +5d8.</p>\n<p>Chain 3: The affected creature must make a Strength saving throw, being pushed 60 feet into the air, as you leap after them, making another melee taijutsu attack. On a hit, you push them back to the ground, as they take double the fall damage they normally would and fall Prone.</p>",
